==Belarusian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|be|sla-pro|*ledъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{be-IPA}}
* {{audio|be|Be-лёд.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{be-noun|((лёд<c.plstem:ільд.genu>,лёд<b*.stem:ільд.genu>,лёд<b*.genu>))|adj=лядо́вы|adj2=лёдавы|adj3=ледзяны́|dim=лядо́к}}

# [[ice]]

====Usage notes====
* The forms beginning with '''іль-''' are used at the beginning of a clause and after words ending in consonants. The forms beginning with '''ль-''' are used after vowels:
*: {{uxi|be|пад '''ільдо́м''' / пад '''лёдам'''|under the ice}}
*: {{uxi|be|бале́т на '''лёдзе'''|ballet on ice}}

